"{path}. Set the key [\"cli\"][\"phpcli_path\"] to it in config/"
"local.config.php, then reload php-fpm."
msgstr ""
"Chemin PHP-CLI recommandé (correspond à la version web {web} et possède "
"pdo_mysql) : {path}. Définir la clé [\"cli\"][\"phpcli_path\"] dessus dans "
"config/local.config.php, puis recharger php-fpm."

#: src/Controller/Admin/CheckAndFixController.php:1381
msgid ""
"No php-cli binary was found, only a php-cgi one ({path}); a php-cli binary "
"is strongly preferred for jobs. If you must use it, set [\"cli\"]"
